[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246788] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246789] STATS: ENCODING: S → class_id
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246790] STATS:   1. Sort speaker IDs: S' = sorted(S)
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246791] STATS:   2. Find lexicographic index of S'
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246792] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246793] STATS: DECODING: class_id → S
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246794] STATS:   1. Find k: Σ(j=0 to k-1) C(5,j) ≤ class_id < Σ(j=0 to k) C(5,j)
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246795] STATS:   2. Reconstruct combination from remaining index
[2025-10-22 21:12:49.246796] STATS: 
